    "CoiStatement": "CONFLICTS OF INTEREST The hyperthermia system was rented from the Celsius 42+ GmbH Company for prospective clinical studies using hyperthermia in combination with radiotherapy for primary and metastatic liver tumors.",
    "DateCompleted": {
